WEBVTT

00:00.500 --> 00:03.100
If my phone can scan a QR code,

00:03.350 --> 00:04.650
why can’t my laptop?

00:05.200 --> 00:06.400
I kept asking that

00:06.400 --> 00:08.350
when the code was already on my screen.

00:08.650 --> 00:11.100
So I built UniQR.

00:11.950 --> 00:13.100
Press one shortcut.

00:13.200 --> 00:14.500
Select the scanned link

00:14.500 --> 00:17.200
and open it directly in your browser.

00:17.600 --> 00:20.200
It works on Windows, Mac, and Linux.

00:20.700 --> 00:22.450
It’s free and open source.

00:23.000 --> 00:24.350
Still reaching for your phone?

00:24.600 --> 00:28.000
Try UniQR.
